    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_honoo_sp01_01",
      "hash64": "C24D2E51CE0315CB",
      "text": "That match against Kieran—it was totally at max\\nheat! You were seriously cookin’![VAR 0x0114(0047)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 81,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0047"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_honoo_sp01_02",
      "hash64": "C24D2F51CE03177E",
      "text": "I still can’t believe what I saw—Kieran had been\\nundefeated since he came back from Kitakami,\\r\\nbut you floored him just like that![VAR 0x0114(0047)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 132,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0047"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_honoo_sp01_03",
      "hash64": "C24D3051CE031931",
      "text": "No wonder the whole BB League’s blazing with\\nexcitement now![VAR 0x0114(0047)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 60,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0047"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_honoo_sp01_04",
      "hash64": "C24D3151CE031AE4",
      "text": "But now that you’ve become Champion, that\\nmeans Kieran gets bumped down to being one\\r\\nof the Elite Four...[VAR 0x0114(0047)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 84,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 108,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0047"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_honoo_sp01_05",
      "hash64": "C24D3251CE031C97",
      "text": "So the weakest Elite Four member’s gotta move\\nout to make room. Unfortunately, that means me![VAR 0x0114(0047)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0047"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_honoo_sp01_select_01",
      "hash64": "3E4ABBAA2F752252",
      "text": "Oh, really?",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_honoo_sp01_select_02",
      "hash64": "3E4ABAAA2F75209F",
      "text": "Sorry about that!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_honoo_sp01_06",
      "hash64": "C24D3351CE031E4A",
      "text": "Yeah, it kinda sucks, but those’re the rules!\\nNothing you or I can do, really![VAR 0x0114(0047)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 78,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0047"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_honoo_sp01_07",
      "hash64": "C24D3451CE031FFD",
      "text": "’Sides, the League Club’s back to the way it used\\nto be. I prefer it this way![VAR 0x0114(0047)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 78,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0047"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_honoo_sp01_08",
      "hash64": "C24D2551CE030680",
      "text": "[VAR 0xBD06(0000)]And it’s all thanks to you,\\n[VAR 0x0100(0000)]!\\r\\nSo\\r\\nthank\\r\\nyou,\\r\\nstraight\\r\\nfrom\\r\\nthe\\r\\nchef’s\\r\\nmouth,\\r\\nso\\r\\nto speak![VAR 0x0114(0047)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
